Write a verilog module that implements a 4-bit adder with carry-in and carry-out. The module should take two 4-bit inputs (A and B) and a carry-in input (Cin), and output a 4-bit sum (S) and a carry-out (Cout). The module should use full-adders to perform the addition.

Use the following template to implement the module:
```
module adder_4bit (A, B, Cin, S, Cout);
